{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Store-aware git status (the path->store resolver, read side): runs porcelain status (-uall) through dev.git.read and translates every data/<lib>/ path into its store identity - control, facet attachment, command record, typed impl, _patches journal, controls index, asset - grouped by unit (lib.control); generated sources under newbound_core/src/<lib>/<ctl>/ join their unit, so an untracked facet reads as WHAT it is instead of a sharded hash path. Deleted store paths are named via git show HEAD: (the live store no longer knows them). Untracked noise outside the store collapses to per-directory counts. Returns {groups, other, text} - text is the render the git panel's 'store' button shows. Read-only.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse ndata::data::Data;","params":[{"name":"repo","type":"String"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"olzqvh1a05d34239fp1","readers":[],"time":1788270142862,"username":"system","writers":[]}